# Reference only. NOTHING LOADS THIS FILE AUTOMATICALLY.
# Neither app imports python-dotenv, and Pixeltable does not read .env.
# Export these in your shell instead, before the first `pxt` command:
#
#   export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-...
#
# The first pxt command starts the daemon; the service inherits its environment, so a key
# exported afterwards never reaches /ask. `pxt config --section anthropic` shows what the
# daemon resolved. For a persistent alternative, set [anthropic] api_key in
# ~/.pixeltable/config.toml.
#
# Exception: `docker compose` reads a .env from the compose project directory (chat-agent/),
# which is its own mechanism and unrelated to the above.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key
